      867      skip "Будем приравнивать календарную дату к сменной?"
      868      view-as alert-box question buttons yes-no update glog.
      869      if glog = no then return error.
      870                    else assign varupd-obj-date = yes.
      871   end.
      872   define variable vardata-valid as logical no-undo.
      873   define variable varmessage    as character no-undo.
      874   run integerm in this-procedure (
      875       input  s-name,
      876       input  no,
      877       input  no,
      878       output s-name-int,
      879       output vardata-valid,
      880       output varmessage ) no-error.
